  "segments": [
   {
    "id": "t1",
    "start": 0.0,
    "end": 3.68,
    "text": "I regret getting the vaccine even though I'm a 52-year-old woman"
   },
   {
    "id": "t2",
    "start": 3.68,
    "end": 6.48,
    "text": "because I don't think I needed it."
   },
   {
    "id": "t3",
    "start": 6.48,
    "end": 7.6,
    "text": "I think I would have been fine."
   },
   {
    "id": "t4",
    "start": 7.6,
    "end": 10.0,
    "text": "I'd got COVID many times and it was well past"
   },
   {
    "id": "t5",
    "start": 10.0,
    "end": 12.4,
    "text": "when the vaccine was doing what it was supposed to be doing."
   },
   {
    "id": "t6",
    "start": 13.44,
    "end": 14.96,
    "text": "And then for the first time,"
   },
   {
    "id": "t7",
    "start": 14.96,
    "end": 17.6,
    "text": "I tested positive for an autoimmune issue"
   },
   {
    "id": "t8",
    "start": 17.6,
    "end": 18.48,
    "text": "at my annual physical."
   },
   {
    "id": "t9",
    "start": 19.2,
    "end": 21.92,
    "text": "And I went to the best rheumatologist in New York"
   },
   {
    "id": "t10",
    "start": 21.92,
    "end": 22.72,
    "text": "and I asked her,"
   },
   {
    "id": "t11",
    "start": 22.72,
    "end": 23.92,
    "text": "do you think this could have to do"
   },
   {
    "id": "t12",
    "start": 23.92,
    "end": 26.56,
    "text": "with the fact that I got the damn booster"
   },
   {
    "id": "t13",
    "start": 26.56,
    "end": 28.48,
    "text": "and then got COVID within three weeks?"
   },
   {
    "id": "t14",
    "start": 28.48,
    "end": 32.96,
    "text": "and she said, yes, yes, I wasn't the only one she'd seen that with."
   }
  ]
 },
